  <entry>
    <id>http://arxiv.org/abs/2101.00001v2</id>
    <title>Wrapped Titles &amp; Escaped Entities: A Study of
  Whitespace in the arXiv API</title>
    <updated>2021-02-01T00:00:00Z</updated>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2101.00001v2" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2101.00001v2" rel="related" type="application/pdf" title="pdf"/>
    <summary>  The arXiv API hard-wraps abstracts at column 80 and indents every
continuation line, so a naive reader sees layout where the paper has prose.
It also escapes &amp;, &lt;, and &gt; as entities. We show that q &lt; p &amp;&amp; p &gt; 0
survives a round trip.
</summary>
